  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the pork sausage, onion, bell pepper, garlic, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Thread a piece of uni onto a skewer, followed by a piece of the sausage mixture, and repeat until the skewer is full.",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil and place them on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Bake the skewers in the preheated oven for 12 minutes, or until crispy and golden brown.",
    "Remove the skewers from the oven and let them cool for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the skewers warm and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley or chives, if desired."
  ],
